## Color and Opacity at a ColorSamples count of 1, bare then bracketed, each followed by
## a Sphere so a mis-counted read desyncs the next parse. Not third-party.
Display "colorsamples_1.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 0.125
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Color [ 0.25 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity 0.375
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
Opacity [ 0.5 ]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
